        "text": "\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); text-align: center\"><span class=\"bold\"><span style=\"color:#696969\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Focusing on the brand value of &quot;i&quot; in &quot;intraw&quot; and providing a space draft containing individual characteristics, we have created icons for those who express &quot;individual&quot;. The &#x27;n&#x27; of &#x27;intraw&#x27; is embodied, and at the same time, the &#x27;home&#x27; shape that can express the &#x27;home styling contest platform&#x27; is made into an icon.</span></span></span></span><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); text-align: center\"><span class=\"bold\"><span style=\"color:#696969\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); text-align: center\"><span class=\"bold\"><span style=\"color:#696969\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">This logo is designed to reflect the core values of &#x27;intraw&#x27;, &#x27;home styling contest platform&#x27; and &#x27;providing individual interior design drafts&#x27;. The &#x27;in&#x27; of &#x27;intraw&#x27; is expressed in bold icon form, and elements of &#x27;individual&#x27; and &#x27;home styling&#x27; are included in it. Therefore, this logo clearly conveys the brand&#x27;s identity while emphasizing the image of a startup company in a modern and clean style.</span></span></span></span><br></div>\n  ",
